## Core Command Groups

### epic

Manage epics.

```bash
list
get
create
update
delete
search
breakdown
```

### feature

Manage features.

```bash
list
get
create
update
delete
assign
estimate
```

### sprint

Manage sprints.

```bash
list
capacity
status
planning
```

### pi

Manage Program Increments.

```bash
list
status
risks
objectives
dependencies
```

### art

Manage Agile Release Trains.

```bash
list
teams
capacity
sync
assign
```

### ai

AI-powered agile workflows.

```bash
breakdown
refine
summarize
risks
dependencies
plan
```

