## Example Workflows

### Create an Epic

```bash
kvasar epic create \
  --title "Payment Integration" \
  --description "Integrate Stripe Connect into onboarding"
```

### Generate Features with AI

```bash
kvasar ai breakdown EPIC-123
```

### Analyze Sprint Capacity

```bash
kvasar sprint capacity --team backend
```

### PI Risk Analysis

```bash
kvasar ai risks PI-12
```

### Sync with Jira

```bash
kvasar jira sync
```

