## MCP Server

The CLI includes an MCP server for AI agents.

```bash
kvasar mcp
```

### MCP Config

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "kvasar": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["kvasar-cli", "mcp"],
      "env": {
        "KVASAR_API_TOKEN": "kvs_xxxxx"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

