## Tips for AI Agents

1. Use `--help` before guessing commands
2. Parse JSON output directly
3. Use `--pretty` only for humans
4. Use `--quiet` for automation
5. Use AI workflows for planning and refinement
6. Use sprint and PI analysis commands before planning
7. Kvasar is SAFe-native and optimized for enterprise agile orchestration

